WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.410
My Name is Vivian Hughbanks, and I'm homeschooled
from Signal Mountain Tennessee.

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.060
I graduated in 2012.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:09.050
Now I'm a journalism German and politics major
at Hillsdale College and a member of the Dow

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.690
Journalism program.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.610
This semester I'm interning at Town Hall Media
as part of Hillsdale's Washington Hillsdale

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.620
Internship Program.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.720
The Washington Hillsdale Internship Program,
we call it WHIP for short, We bring anywhere

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.240
between ten to twenty students a semester
out to DC.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.689
They take two or three classes and they intern
on the hill, at the Heritage Foundation, really

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:30.050
anywhere want to.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:35.660
When we find somebody coming out of college
who has some practical real world experience,

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.340
especially experience that applies to what
we do, it really sets them apart.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.331
Washington is one of those places that kids
can learn a lot and gain a lot just from being

00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:47.460
hear for a few months.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:51.390
And in that since coming here and having that
interning experience, I can guarantee will

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:52.839
be life changing.

